  "content_text": "\r\n    \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n            Manhattan Active SCALE Documentation\r\n        Insight Routing\r\n    \r\n    \r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \r\n    \r\nUser Interface Extensibility\r\n > Metadata Web Pages\r\n > Insight Pages\r\n > Insight Routing\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        There is a single Insight controller and single view that interpret metadata and render controls dynamically at runtime. Please see the Metadata Page Architecture topic for more details. The following routes are currently defined for the Insight screens and can be used interchangeably.\r\n\r\n\r\n    \r\n        \r\n            Name\r\n\r\n            Template\r\n\r\n            Example\r\n\r\n            Description\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n            Insight\r\n\r\n            Insights/{id}\r\n\r\n            localhost/scale/insights/10000\r\n\r\n            Calls index method for “Insight” controller passing the specified Form Id.\r\n        \r\n\r\n        \r\n            Default\r\n\r\n            {controller}/{action}/{id}\r\n\r\n            localhost/scale/insight/index/10000\r\n\r\n            Calls index method for “Insight” controller passing the specified Form Id.\r\n        \r\n    \r\n\r\n\r\n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \r\n    \r\n        \n  ©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
  "search_text": "\r\n    \n\r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n            \nManhattan Active SCALE Documentation\n\r\n        \n\nInsight Routing\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n         \n                Collapse All\n                Expand All\n            \r\n        View with Navigation Tools\r\n    \n\r\n    \n\n\n\n\r\nUser Interface Extensibility\r\n > Metadata Web Pages\r\n > Insight Pages\r\n > Insight Routing\n\n\n\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \n\r\n        \nThere is a single Insight controller and single view that interpret metadata and render controls dynamically at runtime. Please see the Metadata Page Architecture topic for more details. The following routes are currently defined for the Insight screens and can be used interchangeably.\n\r\n\r\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n\r\n            \nName\n\r\n\r\n            \nTemplate\n\r\n\r\n            \nExample\n\r\n\r\n            \nDescription\n\r\n        \n\r\n\r\n        \n\r\n            \nInsight\n\r\n\r\n            \nInsights/{id}\n\r\n\r\n            \nlocalhost/scale/insights/10000\n\r\n\r\n            \nCalls index method for “Insight” controller passing the specified Form Id.\n\r\n        \n\r\n\r\n        \n\r\n            \nDefault\n\r\n\r\n            \n{controller}/{action}/{id}\n\r\n\r\n            \nlocalhost/scale/insight/index/10000\n\r\n\r\n            \nCalls index method for “Insight” controller passing the specified Form Id.\n\r\n        \n\r\n    \n\r\n\n\r\n\r\n\n\n\n\n\n            \n            \r\n        \r\n    \n\r\n    \n\r\n        \n\n \n\n \n\n\n\n©2026 Manhattan Associates. All Rights Reserved.\n\n\r\n    \n\r\n    \r\n\r\n    \r\n    \r\n    \r\n",
